### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Register
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "juan.perez",
  "email": "juan.perez@universidad.edu.mx",
  "password": "MiContraseña2026!",
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez"
}

###

### Resend verification (si ya existe)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/verify/email/resend?email=juan.perez@universidad.edu.mx

###

### Confirm verification (usa el token obtenido del correo)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/verify/email/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI"
}

###

### Login (fallará hasta que el usuario sea verificado/activado)
# @name login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "juan.perez",
  "password": "MiContraseña2026!"
}

###

### Refresh
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}

###

### Logout
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

###

### Auth me
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

###

### Users me
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

###

### Users list (admin/security_admin)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

###

### Update user role (admin)
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/USER_UUID_AQUI/role
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "SECURITY_ADMIN"
}

###

### Forgot password
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@universidad.edu.mx"
}

###

### Reset password (usa el token recibido por correo)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PEGAR_RESET_TOKEN_AQUI",
  "newPassword": "NuevaContraseña2026!"
}

###

### Internal get user (si habilitas gateway secret)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/internal/users/USER_UUID_AQUI
X-Gateway-Secret: default-secret-change-me

###

